  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fstore.steampowered.com%252fapp%252f400%252fPortal%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/w0b04gw.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"619\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>這個模組重現了Valve熱門遊戲《傳送門》中的傳送門槍。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>物品：</p><p>&nbsp;</p><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<h4>終界珍珠粉</h4>\n<p><img class=\"aligncenter\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HIqk6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"173\" height=\"136\"></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<h4>微型黑洞</h4>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/okEMp.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"240\" height=\"136\"></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<h4>預設傳送門槍（普通模式）</h4>\n<h4><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2Aa7A.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"240\" height=\"136\"></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p>&nbsp;</p><p>點擊攻擊按鈕發射藍色傳送門，使用物品按鈕發射橘色傳送門。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>舊版資訊：</strong></p><p>1.10.2和1.12.2版本的發布公告與詳細內容請參閱<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fichun.me%252fportal-gun-is-back-heres-whats-new-and-whats-to-come%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">此連結</a>。</p><p>舊版本模組發布頁面請見<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fichun.me%252fmods%252fportalgun%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">此連結</a>。</p>",
